# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# The Pixel 8a's Wi-Fi over minutes (boot-args pcie=5 pcie_delay=60 wifi=8): an address, then a fetch every 20 s, a join
# with a wrong passphrase in the middle (the firmware's failed handshake), more fetches -- what share of them came
# through, across the firmware's recoveries (devices/akita/drivers/wifi: bcm_recover). Each fetch's result is in the log.
/redwood/bin/net_test waitaddr en0 150 fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html
/redwood/bin/net_test wait 20 fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html
/redwood/bin/net_test wrongjoin
/redwood/bin/net_test wait 20 fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html
/redwood/bin/net_test wait 20 fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html
